WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:06.300
I'm betting everything on Yuma and his gift in believing in others!

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:11.350
Bastards... where the hell are Yuma and Kaito?!

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:15.050
Defeat us first to find out!

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.200
Your Numbers...

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:26.770
I'll crush them with my Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.360
Fighting a Galaxy-Eyes Tamer like Kaito...

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.920
... it has to be a twist of fate...

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:36.470
What do you mean?

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:39.120
I'm the one who taught Kaito how to Duel

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:40.920
and made him the man he is today.

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:41.800
Huh...?

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:46.040
Mizael, that means I'm a worthy opponent!

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.670
Good!

00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:50.750
Let's kill two birds with one stone!

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:53.950
You plan to beat both of us?

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:57.950
It seems he underestimates us, dear brother.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:00:59.220
I wonder.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:01.710
If either of you

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:05.000
thinks you'll be able to stand before my Neo Tachyon...

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:09.220
Then I shall give you a lesson!

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:11.650
Let's go, Michael!

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:13.510
Got it, brother!

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:18.400
Duel Disk, set!

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:33.870
Duel!

00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:40.850
What did you say!?  "Go to Nasch and trick him to go back to the Barian World?"

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:46.000
Yup. But we can't afford to fight both Nasch and Yuma.

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:47.570
What do you mean?

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:51.650
As for you, Alito, you continue to search for Yuma.

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:52.770
What?!

00:01:53.150 --> 00:01:54.950
Gimme a break, Vector!

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.380
Why the hell should we listen to you?

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:00.020
Hey, come on!

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:03.820
who do you think woke you up for that long nap 'o yours, huh?

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:07.000
Huh?! What d'you wanna say by that?!

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:10.120
Good grief, do you two need...

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:13.020
another juice-up before you stop being pieces of crap...?

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:15.020
... from Don Thousand?

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:17.500
Do- Don Thousand!?

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:24.820
He... He's really...!
No way!!

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:32.770
Let me give you a further taste of my power.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:38.350
Vector, you...! Don Thousand's Power, you idiot...!

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:49.850
With this, you two are my puppets.

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:52.520
Now let's get to work!

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:57.800
Yuma...

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:01.520
... went to another universe to save the world?

00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:02.820
Yes..

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:07.300
He told us to tell you two not to word.

00:03:08.470 --> 00:03:11.950
So- something like "another universe"... There's no way...

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:14.000
Something like that...

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:16.100
Yuma...

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:19.950
That idiot!

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:23.970
Wait. Where do you think you're going, young lady?

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:26.970
Grandma! Well...

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:29.350
You heard them both.

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:32.420
Yuma told us not to worry, dear.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:34.950
But... He went to another universe!

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:37.850
To save the world! That's just so ridiculous-

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:39.720
Yuma said he'd come back!

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:44.700
That he absolutely... definitely comes back safe and sound!

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:47.000
That's right, no matter what!

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:51.030
So, we'll wait and trust Yuma.

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:53.470
That's good enough for us.

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:58.820
Anyways, until Yuma comes home...

00:03:58.870 --> 00:04:02.570
I guess I'll make some Duel Rice for him.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:07.670
<i>Yuma... Your big sis believes in you...</i>

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:13.370
Are you thinking about V and III?

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:17.550
Yeah, we had fought before we split up...

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:23.320
I get why they'd wanna get revenge for their brother IV...

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:27.550
But nothin' comes from Duelin' when your angry.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:30.450
I wanted to tell 'em that...

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:33.850
Yuma...
 You may think so,

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:36.600
but as far as they're concerned, it's right.

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:42.220
They believe they're taking the right path.

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:45.920
It is... we can only follow

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:48.680
the path we think is the right one, don't we?

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:52.680
Even if we don't know where it'll lead in the end.

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:58.400
Ah, yeah, I know.

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:04.220
<i>V... III...</i>

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:05.310
{marker}

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:09.490
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:14.730
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:26.420
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:05:26.780 --> 00:05:30.600
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:37.420
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:41.400
the feelings I want to express.

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:50.420
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:53.670
Right now, with you

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:57.600
Oh - By facing each other,

00:05:57.930 --> 00:06:04.680
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:09.780
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:06:10.310 --> 00:06:15.210
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:20.380
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:29.960
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.830
For this Duel,

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:42.500
you two shall be sharing Life Points.

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:47.470
<i>The Unflinching Brother Combo - Tachyon Dragon Imprisoned!</i>

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:46.630
Fine. But we get to go first.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:49.050
Me, then you. - Got it.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.970
My turn, Draw!

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:57.060
I activate the effect of Deep Space Cruiser 9 in my hand!

00:06:58.020 --> 00:06:58.980
This card...

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:04.020
can be Special Summoned by sending another Machine-Type Monster from my hand to the Graveyard.

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:06.650
I have one other Machine-Type.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:09.610
I send Deep Space Cruiser 9 from my hand to the Graveyard.

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:14.950
Show yourself, Deep Space Cruiser 9.

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:20.120
Then, my Spell Card Monster Reborn

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:23.960
Special Summons Deep Space Cruiser 9 from the Graveyard!

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:30.340
I take my two Level 9 Deep Space Cruiser 9s to

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:31.760
overlay!

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:35.760
I construct the Overlay Network with these two monsters!

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:37.930
Xyz Summon!

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:41.980
Show yourself, Number 9.

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:50.280
Canopy Star, Dyson Sphere!

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:52.280
So your Number showed up.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:53.660
That's...

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.030
Dyson Sphere?!

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:59.080
It seems a Duel has started over there.

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:02.670
And now, I activate the Spell Card,

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:05.040
Magic Summon Breakdown!

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:08.050
During the next turn, my opponent

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:11.050
cannot Special Summon using a Spell Card.

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:15.470
I analyzed the Duel Data about you Seven Emperors,

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:19.680
that my younger brother, Thomas, sent me.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:25.520
Your group's Key Card is "Rank-Up Magic The Seventh One"!

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:30.570
Ho. So you intend to prevent me from Summoning my Neo Tachyon?

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:31.900
Interesting.

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:37.320
I set two cards face-down and end my turn.

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.950
Huh!? Brother!

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.460
Mizael, who are they?

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:49.630
They're V and III, a pair of skilled Number Users.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:52.720
Now we've got three of the Seven Emperors.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:54.760
<i>So there's four left.</i>

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:56.760
I'm fine here.

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:59.760
You two keep looking for Yuma and Kaito.

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:01.100
Got it.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:02.810
Brother.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:08.940
Though I wanted to wait until the Seven of you showed up...

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:10.690
What!?

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:22.240
You're going to have to hang around a bit longer.

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:23.700
This is...

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:26.460
It seems we're trapped.

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:33.170
Hoo~ Looks like they pulled out a bad field.

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:36.300
How interesting.

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:40.220
Maybe I should treat myself and watch 'em from here?

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:43.810
Durbe, Merag. Don't interfere.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:48.560
It doesn't matter what stupid tricks you pull, I'll still beat you.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:52.480
It seems you plan to beat me by sealing away "The Seventh One",

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:55.190
while making light of me.

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:58.410
My turn, draw!

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:02.370
I'll Special Summon Schwartzchild Limit Dragon from my hand!

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:08.120
When my opponent controls a monster with 2000 or more Attack, this card

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:10.540
can be Special Summoned from my hand!

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:16.260
Then I activate the Spell Card "Ergosphere"!

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:19.680
When I control "Schwartzchild" on my field,

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:23.930
I can add another "Schwatzchild" from my Deck to my hand.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:28.560
And since there is a monster with 2000 or more Attack on my opponent's field,

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:31.650
I can Special Summon my other "Schwartzchild"!

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:36.490
I'll show you...

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:39.910
... the power of the true Galaxy-Eyes!

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:44.830
I overlay my two Level 8 Schwartzchilds!

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:49.330
I build the Overlay Network with these two monsters!

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:51.000
Xyz Summon!

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:55.880
Manifest yourself, Numbers 107!

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:04.430
Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:15.860
So that's his Galaxy-Eyes!?

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:24.160
So a Duel's started somewhere around here?

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:26.830
There's a problem, Nasch!

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:28.450
What's up?

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:31.750
Yuma and his friends ain't in the Human World anymore!

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:32.750
What?

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:36.000
It seems they're goin' to the Barian World somehow.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:37.630
The Barian World?

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:40.800
Yuma...

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:44.260
Girag. - Yeah? - Return to the Barian World!

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:51.600
Yeah... I guess I should hurry...

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:59.610
I take Tachyon Dragon to attack Dyson Sphere!

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:02.860
Tachyon Spiral of Destruction!

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:05.450
Your attack is useless!

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:07.910
I activate Dyson Sphere's effect!

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:10.960
While this card has Overlay Units,

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:13.960
the attacks of my opponent's monsters are negated!

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:18.590
And now I activate the effect of Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:22.420
Once per turn, once the Battle Phase has ended...

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:24.760
I can detach one Overlay Unit from this card,

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:29.310
and of all monsters on the field the effects are negated, except this card's!

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:33.480
Tachyon Trans Migration!

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:49.580
Plus, for each card used during this Battle Phase, Tachion Dragon will...

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:52.540
... gain 1000 Attack!

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:57.670
You activate the effect of Dyson Sphere once during the Battle Phase!

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:02.010
Thus, Tachyon gains 1000 Attack!

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:07.800
Now, slip back through the Time-Space Continuum, and reappear once more!

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:11.720
Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:18.230
Even though the Battle Phase is over, it gained Attack!?

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:21.860
Heh... The effect of Tachyon Transmigration allows

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:25.950
Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon to attack again!

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.070
What?!

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:31.200
This is Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon's

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:32.580
true terror...

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:37.250
It's able to go back in time and choose a future that benefits it.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:39.210
And now,

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:40.920
because of Tachyon Trans Migration,

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:44.050
Dyson Sphere has lost its effect!

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:48.760
Go, Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.310
Attack Dyson Sphere!

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:54.810
Tachyon Spiral of Destruction!

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:15.700
For you mongrels...

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:18.460
... this Tachyon Dragon should be enough!

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:21.210
I won't need to bring out my Neo Tachyon.

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:25.420
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:29.300
And now, Tachyon Dragon's Attack returns to normal.

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:35.430
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:38.890
The Dyson Sphere that was in the sky disappeared.

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:40.770
It couldn't be... V and III...

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:42.270
Don't lose your head!

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:46.780
Those two need to do what they need to do, even if they have to risk their lives for it.

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:50.320
We will do the things that we have to do.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.490
And not look back!

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.450
At your service!

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:58.710
This is Tachyon's power.

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:02.000
Interesting. Makes it worth beating it.

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:03.630
"Beat it"?

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:08.010
That's right. We'll beat you no matter what!

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:11.390
My turn, draw!

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:15.810
I Normal Summon OOPArts Gordias Unite!

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:20.520
When this card is Normal Summoned...

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:25.360
One "OOPArts" monster from my hand with 1000 or less ATK,

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:28.400
can be special summoned, but its effects are negated.

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:31.860
Come out, OOPArts Sol Monolith!

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:35.580
Gordias Unite's Level becomes Level 6,

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:40.250
just like the Sol Monolith it Special Summoned by its effect.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:45.920
I Overlay my Level 6 Gordias Unite and Sol Monolith!

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:51.300
I build the Overlay Network with these two monsters!

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:53.640
Xyz Summon!

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:57.850
Appear, Number 6!

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:09.690
OOPArts Atlantal!

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:15.030
This is your Number, you... interesting...

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:18.660
When this card is Xyz Summoned,

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:21.790
I can equip 1 "Number" monster in the Graveyard to it,

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:25.170
and Atlantal gains Attack equal to that monster's Attack!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:29.340
Right now, Dyson Sphere is in the Graveyard!

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:33.010
And with this, Atlantal's Attack instantly

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:35.430
increases to 5400!

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:40.890
I won't let you! I activate the Continuous Trap, "Tachyon Flare Wing"!

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:44.980
When you Xyz Summon a monster, this card...

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:47.560
Equips to a Galaxy Eyes!

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:54.950
Then this card negates the effects of my opponent's Xyz Monster!

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:03.410
Now, your Atlantal can't defeat my Tachyon Dragon!

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:04.710
Wanna bet?

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:07.790
We already figured this would happen.

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:09.040
What?!

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.760
Michael! Use your Set Card!

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:16.430
Got it! You don't need to say anything else!

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:23.230
Rank-Up Magic Argent Chaos Force, activate!

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:33.280
You curs!

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:44.080
I Overlay my Rank 6 Atlantal!

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:48.630
I re-construct the Overlay Network with this single Monster!

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:50.750
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.130
Descend!

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:58.680
Chaos Number 6!

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:03.890
Shatter the Limited Space-Time Continuum!

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:07.940
and engrave your existence into the whole of creation, now!

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:16.860
OOPArts Chaos Atlantal!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:21.660
Those bastards... have a Rank-Up-Magic too...?

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:25.830
This is the real performance. Go! Chaos Atlantal!

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:28.330
Attack his Tachyon Dragon!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.420
Chaos Punishment!

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:37.420
As if! I activate Tachyon Flare Wing's effect!

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:40.050
When the equipped monster would be destroyed,

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.600
I can send this card to the Graveyard

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:46.600
to negate that destruction!

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:56.780
Hmph, it looks like the odds just aren't in your favor for destroying my Tachyon Dragon.

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:58.450
What a pity.

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:03.620
I was waiting for that.
What!?

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:06.580
Since Tachyon Flare Wing's destroyed,

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:10.000
I can activate Chaos Atlantal's effect.

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:14.460
I can make a monster that battled this card

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:16.590
an Equip Card to this card!

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:18.470
"Equip"!?

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:21.010
Let's go! Chaos Atlantal!

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:23.550
Rob him of his Tachyon Dragon!

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.810
Tachyon Dragon!

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:36.230
And for each card Equipped to it,

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:40.030
Chaos Atlantal gains an additional 1000 Attack!

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:50.580
Yo-... you mongrel...!

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:54.290
He stole Tachyon Dragon!
 It seems so!

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:58.260
They planned this, all of this, for the sake of Equipping Tachyon Dragon.

00:19:58.260 --> 00:20:03.180
At first glance, it looked like Tachyon Flare Wing allowed it to escape destruction,

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:06.430
but all it ended up doing was leaving it defenseless...

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:10.730
They have been waiting for this chance.

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:18.110
You... fucking cheats!

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:24.570
Never before I had to taste such a humiliation...!

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:27.080
I'm honored to receive such a compliment, 'Sir'.

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:31.500
I set two cards face-down and end my turn!

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:36.960
But, don't think you've got me entrapped with this.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:39.250
My turn.

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:42.920
Barian's Chaos Draw!

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:49.430
I drew "Rank-Up-Magic The Seventh One"!

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:53.730
With this I can call Neo Tachyon Dragon whenever I wa-...

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:04.450
I see. Your real aim was...

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:09.790
The Seventh One is a card capable of summoning

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:12.450
an Over-Hundred Number from the Extra Deck or Graveyard,

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:15.580
and then Ranking it Up by Chaos-ifying it.

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:20.880
But right now Tachyon Dragon isn't in the Graveyard nor Extra Deck!

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:25.340
We took it as Equip Card without destroying your Monster, before you could chaos-ify it.

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:28.760
This is the only chink in "The Seventh One"'s Armor.

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:32.060
This was your plan from the beginning...

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:37.150
To prevent me from ever summoning Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon in the first place?

00:21:41.270 --> 00:21:43.110
Ohmy, baby...

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:47.530
Miza-<i>chan</i> honey, maybe you aren't such hot stuff after all?

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:56.870
With this, your wings are essentially plucked.

00:21:57.580 --> 00:21:59.380
What will you do now?

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:11.850
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:16.230
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.310 --> 00:22:18.520
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.560 --> 00:22:22.190
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:23.980 --> 00:22:24.820
Let it go.

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:38.080
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:43.300
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:49.220
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:54.560
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.680 --> 00:22:59.350
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.810 --> 00:23:05.280
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:07.440
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:11.820
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:15.700
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:17.450
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:21.920
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:24.040
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:26.880
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:29.300
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:32.800
Challenge the GAME

00:23:41.270 --> 00:23:45.400
After sealing Tachyon Dragon, V and III also manage to chaosify Dyson Sphere,

00:23:45.520 --> 00:23:47.530
and are able to build a huge advantage.

00:23:47.940 --> 00:23:50.450
At the moment when the match is about to be settled,

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:53.280
That power... don't tell me Gilag, you...

00:23:53.620 --> 00:23:55.200
At this rate, they will...!

00:23:55.410 --> 00:23:56.910
You can't go, Yuma!

00:23:57.200 --> 00:23:59.160
I'm really glad I met you...

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:02.170
Next on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II:

00:24:02.170 --> 00:24:05.750
Tears of Farewell... The Tyranny of Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:08.630
Stop it, III!
